.Dd February 11, 2026
.Dt VOP_READ 9
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm vop_read
.Nd read data from a vnode into a uio
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In sys/param.h
.In sys/uio.h
.In vfs/vnode.h
.Ft int
.Fn vop_read "struct vnode *vp" "struct uio *uio" "int ioflag" "struct ucred *cred"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Fn vop_read
validates the uio request, handles regular-file EOF fast-paths,
and calls the filesystem read callback.
On successful data transfer, access-time update state is marked in
.Fa vp->v_flag .
.Sh RETURN VALUES
Returns 0 on success, or an error number.
.Sh ERRORS
.Bl -tag -width "[EOPNOTSUPP]"
.It Bq Er EINVAL
Invalid uio descriptor.
.It Bq Er EOPNOTSUPP
The vnode does not implement read.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr vnode 9 ,
.Xr vop_write 9
